                "extract": "<p>The <b>Eggstock</b> is a mountain of the Schwyzer Alps, located on the border between the Swiss cantons of Schwyz and Glarus, north of Braunwald. It lies on the range east of the B\u00f6s Fulen, between the valley of B\u00f6sb\u00e4chi and the cirque of Braunwald and is composed of three summits: the <i>Hinterer Eggstock</i> (2,455\u00a0m [8,054\u00a0ft]), the <i>Mittlerer Eggstock</i> (2,436\u00a0m [7,992\u00a0ft]) and the <i>Vorderer Eggstock</i> (2,449\u00a0m [8,035\u00a0ft]).\n</p>\n<h2 data-mw-anchor=\"See_also\" data-mw-wikitext=\"\">See also</h2>\n<ul><li>List of mountains of the canton of Glarus</li>\n<li>List of mountains of the canton of Schwyz</li></ul>\n<h2 data-mw-anchor=\"References\" data-mw-wikitext=\"\">References</h2>\n\n<h2 data-mw-anchor=\"External_links\" data-mw-wikitext=\"\">External links</h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"></span> Media related to Eggst\u00f6cke at Wikimedia Commons\n</p>\n<ul><li>Hinterer Eggstock on Hikr</li></ul>\n<p><br/>\n</p>"
